{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LrrgqcdLz4eJF5EcuZ9Wkn","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (33.6KB). Full output saved to: /capture/claude-config/projects/-workspace-project/7c6b26fa-c2b4-46c3-bcb4-060f368422ad/tool-results/bk91s28lx.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\nHEAD detached at 17128d5\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\n17128d5 feat: scaffold app\ntotal 504\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 node  node    4096 Nov  2 08:39 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 agent agent   4096 Nov  3 14:32 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node  node    4096 Nov  3 14:32 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node     812 Nov  2 08:39 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node       7 Nov  2 08:39 .nvmrc\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node     150 Nov  2 08:39 .prettierignore\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node      47 Nov  2 08:39 .prettierrc\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node  node    4096 Nov  2 08:39 .vscode\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node    1008 Nov  2 08:39 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node  node    4096 Nov  2 08:39 apps\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node    4579 Nov  2 08:39 db.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node     721 Nov  2 08:39 eslint.config.mjs\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 node  node    4096 Nov  2 08:39 node_modules\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node    1042 Nov  2 08:39 nx.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node    1227 Nov  2 08:39 package.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node  437328 Nov  2 08:39 pnpm-lock.yaml\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node     117 Nov  2 08:39 pnpm-workspace.yaml\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node  node    4096 Nov  2 08:39 spec\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node  node     451 Nov  2 08:39 tsconfig.base.json\nspec/README.md\nspec/stack.md\nspec/tickets/01-movie-list.md\nspec/tickets/02-auditorium-map.md\nspec/tickets/03-seat-selection.md\nspec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md\nspec/tickets/05-checkout.md\nspec/tickets/06-confirmation.md\nspec/tickets/07-final-pass.md\nspec/tickets/README.md\n# Cinescope — cinema seat booking\n\nA web application for booking cinema seats. A customer picks a day and a movie screening,\nchooses seats on a map of the auditorium, reviews the tickets, fills in