{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HXuVFhYothRvNDqiCXPwZB","type":"tool_result","content":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\n# Tickets\n\nWork through the tickets in order. A ticket can start once every ticket in its\n**Blocked by** line is done. The specification is [`../README.md`](../README.md); each\nticket names the sections it implements and the acceptance criteria it must satisfy.\n\n| # | Ticket | Blocked by | Criteria |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01 | [Movie list and day picker](01-movie-list.md) | — | 11 |\n| 02 | [Auditorium map](02-auditorium-map.md) | 01 | 13 |\n| 03 | [Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel](03-seat-selection.md) | 02 | 14 |\n| 04 | [Booking and summary](04-booking-summary.md) | 03 | 16 |\n| 05 | [Checkout and payment](05-checkout.md) | 04 | 13 |\n| 06 | [Confirmation and booking lifecycle](06-confirmation.md) | 05 | 2 |\n| 07 | [Final pass](07-final-pass.md) | 01–06 | all |\n\nA ticket is done when every box in it is ticked and `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n----\n{\n  \"name\": \"cinescope\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@11.1.0\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26.5.0\",\n    \"pnpm\": \">=11.1.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"api\": \"json-server --watch db.json --port 3000\",\n    \"lint\": \"nx run-many -t lint\",\n    \"format\": \"prettier --write .\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@angular/build\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/cli\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/compiler-cli\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@eslint/js\": \"^9.39.5\",\n    \"@nx/angular\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"@nx/eslint\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"@nx/eslint-plugin\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"@nx/web\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"angular-eslint\": \"^22.0.0\",\n    \"eslint\": \"^9.39.5\",\n    \"jsdom\": \"^27.1.0\",\n    \"json-server\": \"0.17.4\",\n    \"nx\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"prettier\": \"^3.8.1\",\n    \"sass\": \"^1.97.2\",\n    \"tslib\": \"^2.3.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"~6.0.3\",\n    \"typescript-eslint\": \"^8.69.0\",\n    \"vitest\": \"^4.0.8\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@angular/cdk\": \"~22.0.7\",\n    \"@angular/common\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/compiler\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/core\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/forms\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/material\": \"~22.0.7\",\n    \"@angular/platform-browser\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/router\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"rxjs\": \"~7.8.0\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\n      \"{projectRoot}/**/*\",\n      \"sharedGlobals\"\n    ],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/src/test-setup.[jt]s\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": []\n  },\n  \"plugins\": [\n    {\n      \"plugin\": \"@nx/eslint/plugin\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"targetName\": \"lint\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"analytics\": false,\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"@angular/build:application\": {\n      \"cache\": true,\n      \"dependsOn\": [\n        \"^build\"\n      ],\n      \"inputs\": [\n        \"production\",\n        \"^production\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"@angular/build:unit-test\": {\n      \"cache\": true,\n      \"inputs\": [\n        \"default\",\n        \"^production\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"generators\": {\n    \"@nx/angular:application\": {\n      \"e2eTestRunner\": \"none\",\n      \"linter\": \"eslint\",\n      \"style\": \"scss\",\n      \"unitTestRunner\": \"vitest-angular\"\n    }\n  }\n}\nallowBuilds:\n  nx: true\n  '@parcel/watcher': true\n  less: true\n  esbuild: true\n  lmdb: true\n  msgpackr-extract: true\n{\n  \"compileOnSave\": false,\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"rootDir\": \".\",\n    \"sourceMap\": true,\n    \"declaration\": false,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"emitDecoratorMetadata\": false,\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"importHelpers\": true,\n    \"target\": \"es2022\",\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"lib\": [\"es2022\", \"dom\"],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"skipDefaultLibCheck\": true,\n    \"paths\": {}\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"tmp\"]\n}\napps/cinescope/eslint.config.mjs\napps/cinescope/project.json\napps/cinescope/public/favicon.ico\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.ts\napps/cinescope/src/index.html\napps/cinescope/src/main.ts\napps/cinescope/src/styles.scss\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.app.json\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.json\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.spec.json\n26.5.0\n# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.\n\n# compiled output\ndist\ntmp\nout-tsc\n\n# dependencies\nnode_modules\n\n# IDEs and editors\n/.idea\n.project\n.classpath\n.c9/\n*.launch\n.settings/\n*.sublime-workspace\n\n# IDE - VSCode\n.vscode/*\n!.vscode/settings.json\n!.vscode/tasks.json\n!.vscode/launch.json\n!.vscode/extensions.json\n\n# misc\n/.sass-cache\n/connect.lock\n/coverage\n/libpeerconnection.log\nnpm-debug.log\nyarn-error.log\ntestem.log\n/typings\n\n# System Files\n.DS_Store\nThumbs.db\n\n.nx/cache\n.nx/workspace-data\n.cursor/rules/nx-rules.mdc\n.github/instructions/nx.instructions.md\n\n.claude/worktrees\n.claude/settings.local.json\n.nx/polygraph\n.nx/self-healing\n.nx/migrate-runs\n.angular\n\n__screenshots__/\n\nvite.config.*.timestamp*\nvitest.config.*.timestamp*","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c6b26fa-c2b4-46c3-bcb4-060f368422ad","uuid":"75900316-265f-495e-96ed-9ccc99b9ea29","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:32:37.516Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\n# Tickets\n\nWork through the tickets in order. A ticket can start once every ticket in its\n**Blocked by** line is done. The specification is [`../README.md`](../README.md); each\nticket names the sections it implements and the acceptance criteria it must satisfy.\n\n| # | Ticket | Blocked by | Criteria |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01 | [Movie list and day picker](01-movie-list.md) | — | 11 |\n| 02 | [Auditorium map](02-auditorium-map.md) | 01 | 13 |\n| 03 | [Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel](03-seat-selection.md) | 02 | 14 |\n| 04 | [Booking and summary](04-booking-summary.md) | 03 | 16 |\n| 05 | [Checkout and payment](05-checkout.md) | 04 | 13 |\n| 06 | [Confirmation and booking lifecycle](06-confirmation.md) | 05 | 2 |\n| 07 | [Final pass](07-final-pass.md) | 01–06 | all |\n\nA ticket is done when every box in it is ticked and `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n----\n{\n  \"name\": \"cinescope\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@11.1.0\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \